GenericName[uk]=Центр програм
Comment=Browse, install and update software — APT, Flatpak and Snap
Comment[it]=Sfoglia, installa e aggiorna software — APT, Flatpak e Snap
Comment[pl]=Przegladaj, instaluj i aktualizuj oprogramowanie — APT, Flatpak i Snap
